        <zone h='71' id='13' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='-83' y='21912'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#898989' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='850' id='14' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98333' x='750' y='13626'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='850' id='51' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='750' y='13626'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='18'>   How does seasonality impact demand ?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone h='5127' id='15' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98333' x='750' y='14646'>
          <zone h='5127' id='52' name='How does seasonality impact demand?' show-title='false' w='98333' x='750' y='14646'>
            <layout-cache cell-count-w='3' has-max-size-h='true' maxheight='807' minheight='807' non-cell-size-w='74' type-h='scalable' type-w='cell' />
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#dfedeb' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#dfedeb' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='1813' id='16' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98333' x='750' y='19943'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1813' id='53' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='750' y='19943'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>The transition from monthly volatility to seasonal aggregates reveals that the &quot;September Slump&quot; is part of a broader </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Fall trough</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>, where total demand dips below </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>500,000 trips</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>. Surprisingly, the narrative shifts in </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Winter</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>, which emerges as the absolute peak season with over </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>1.5 million trips</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>, far surpassing the Summer baseline. This indicates that while Summer provides intense bursts of activity, the network’s true scaling power and urban resilience are anchored in the colder months. The widening gap between the two user types during this Winter surge suggests that the core &quot;Member&quot; base is the primary engine driving this massive seasonal growth, while casual usage remains relatively flat.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='850' id='17' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98333' x='917' y='22082'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='850' id='56' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='917' y='22082'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='18'>   Who is actually using the system?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone h='7734' id='18' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='50667' x='1000' y='23045'>
          <zone h='7734' id='54' name='Trips vs avg duration by User Type' show-title='false' w='50667' x='1000' y='23045'>
            <layout-cache cell-count-w='2' minheight='122' non-cell-size-w='148' type-h='scalable' type-w='cell' />
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone h='4731' id='19' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='36667' x='58417' y='24292'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4731' id='57' type-v2='text' w='36667' x='58417' y='24292'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>The contrast between user types reveals a &quot;Quantity vs. Quality&quot; dynamic: while </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>members</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> drive the system&apos;s massive scale with over </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>2.5 million trips</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>, their rides are highly efficient, averaging only </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>11 minutes</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>. In contrast, </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>casual riders</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>account for a much lower volume of under </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>500,000 trips</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> but engage in deeper exploration, with an average duration of </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>22 minutes</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>—exactly double that of members. This identifies members as the &quot;Commuter Engine&quot; of the network, utilizing high-frequency, short-burst trips that allow for rapid bike turnover and support the extreme seasonal volumes seen in Winter. Casual riders act as &quot;Explorers,&quot; keeping bikes out of circulation longer for recreational use, which explains why their total trip count remains relatively flat despite longer individual sessions.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='71' id='20' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='-250' y='31006'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#898989' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='850' id='21' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98333' x='1000' y='31161'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='850' id='58' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='1000' y='31161'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='18'>   Where is demand concentrated?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone h='71' id='23' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='-83' y='47054'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#b4b4b4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='1969' id='24' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98333' x='917' y='11360'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1969' id='50' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='917' y='11360'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>The bike-sharing network exhibits high volatility, characterized by a massive peak of over </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>800,000 trips</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> in August 2025 followed by a dramatic &quot;September Slump&quot; to near </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>100,000</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>. This sharp decline likely stems from the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>transition out of peak tourism</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>, </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>back-to-school shifts</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> in commuting habits, or </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>cooling weather patterns</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> following the summer high. While a secondary surge to </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>600,000</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> in December suggests a resilient winter recovery, the overall trend remains reactive rather than consistent. </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Members</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> provide the most stable core volume, whereas </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>casual riders</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> contribute significantly only during peak summer months, highlighting the need for targeted retention during transitional periods.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone h='6544' id='25' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='55667' x='42833' y='38555'>
          <zone h='6544' id='62' name='Station Usage Intensity(Destination) (2)' w='55667' x='42833' y='38555'>
            <layout-cache has-max-size-w='true' maxwidth='813' minwidth='813' type-h='fixed' type-w='scalable' />
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='850' id='26' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98333' x='1000' y='47238'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='850' id='69' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='1000' y='47238'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='18'>   Where to focus for expansion ?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone h='1813' id='28' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='97333' x='1417' y='54958'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1813' id='74' type-v2='text' w='97333' x='1417' y='54958'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>The </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Origin–Destination Matrix</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> confirms a &quot;Hub-Centric&quot; network where intra-borough trips provide the foundational volume, led by Manhattan with over </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>1.6 million member</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> and </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>1.2 million casual</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> internal journeys. While most activity is localized, the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Manhattan–Brooklyn corridor</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> serves as the system&apos;s vital cross-city artery, facilitating nearly </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>140,000 member exchanges</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>. Members are significantly more likely than casual riders to cross borough lines, particularly into the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Bronx</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>, reinforcing their role as the primary engine for long-range, functional transit. In contrast, </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Queens</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> remains relatively isolated from the core network, with the vast majority of its </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>59,000+ member trips</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> staying within borough boundaries.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone h='71' id='29' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='-333' y='66601'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#b4b4b4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='949' id='30' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98333' x='833' y='66884'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='949' id='76' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='833' y='66884'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='18'>   When and how are bikes used?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone h='6643' id='31' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98333' x='833' y='48173'>
          <zone h='6643' id='70' name=' Origin–Destination Trip Matrix by Borough and User Type' w='98333' x='833' y='48173'>
            <layout-cache cell-count-w='4' non-cell-size-w='160' type-h='cell' type-w='cell' />
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='1445' id='32' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98167' x='1000' y='64873'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1445' id='88' type-v2='text' w='98167' x='1000' y='64873'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Expanding on the spatial patterns from the scatter plots, a granular look at individual stations confirms a &quot;Concentrated Start, Dispersed End&quot; dynamic. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>W 21 St &amp; 6 Ave</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> emerges as the primary &quot;Launchpad&quot; with over </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>6,700 member starts</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>, while the most active arrival point—</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>W 41 St &amp; 8 Ave</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>—receives only </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>2,977 member trips</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>. This disparity validates the &quot;Destination Sink&quot; effect, where bikes are picked up from a few core high-density centers but dispersed across a wider variety of end-stations. Consequently, operational success depends on aggressive fleet rebalancing to return bikes to these high-volume starting hubs.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone h='71' id='33' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='-500' y='83952'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#b4b4b4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='6246' id='34' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='96833' x='1500' y='75765'>
          <zone h='6246' id='77' name='Trip Duration by Time of Day' show-title='false' w='96833' x='1500' y='75765'>
