                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='70' h='992' id='124' is-centered='0' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='/Users/paulbedu-osei/Desktop/Screenshot 2026-03-29 at 10.40.25 AM.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='6333' x='27417' y='85666'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='60' h='850' id='126' is-centered='0' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='/Users/paulbedu-osei/Desktop/Screenshot 2026-03-29 at 10.44.12 AM.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='8500' x='65667' y='85666'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='77' h='1091' id='123' is-centered='0' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='/Users/paulbedu-osei/Desktop/Screenshot 2026-03-29 at 10.37.30 AM.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='6083' x='7833' y='85680'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='53' forceUpdate='true' h='864' id='121' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='500' y='89490'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='18'>Conclusion</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='155' forceUpdate='true' h='2210' id='94' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='500' y='90354'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>The network thrives as a high-velocity </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>&quot;Hub &amp; Spoke&quot;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> system, where urban resilience is anchored by a member base performing rapid </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>5–15 minute trips</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>. While demand is volatile—peaking at </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>1.5M trips in Winter</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> but dropping in Fall—the &quot;Commuter Engine&quot; remains remarkably efficient. Future success depends on shifting from reactive rebalancing to proactive expansion that connects isolated outer-borough hubs to the high-density Manhattan-Brooklyn corridor</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='56' h='906' id='122' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='583' y='93598'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='18'>Data Provenance &amp; Methodology</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='184' forceUpdate='true' h='2719' id='96' type-v2='text' w='98333' x='583' y='94504'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>The insights presented in this dashboard are derived from raw system data sourced directly from the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Citi Bike open data portal</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>. The dataset encompasses all recorded trips from </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>July 2025 through February 2026</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>. To ensure a comprehensive longitudinal analysis, individual monthly files were extracted and programmatically joined into a single, unified dataset using </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Python</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>. This centralized data structure allowed for the advanced cleaning, borough-level mapping, and time-series aggregation necessary to identify the high-velocity &quot;Commuter Engine&quot; and seasonal shifts documented throughout this report.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#818b91' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f3faf9' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{34895A5D-674C-4C17-AC84-F4A7107A7F7E}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
